	"title"		"CatalystDefaults - Catalyst on for new production buildings"
	"description"		"[b]Stop flipping the Catalyst switch on every new building.[/b]

Production buildings with a Catalyst slot (smelters, furnaces and the like) start with their Catalyst switched on as soon as construction finishes.

[h2]Features[/h2]
[list]
[*]Setting [i]Production buildings - Catalyst on when built[/i] in the Mods menu (On / Off, default On)
[*]Applies only to buildings finished while the mod is active
[*]Never touches buildings that already exist in your save
[*]Uses the game's own Catalyst command, the same as the switch in the building window
[*]Event-driven: does nothing until a construction finishes, never scans all buildings, so it costs nothing at high game speeds or in big towns
[/list]

[h2]Source[/h2]
[url=https://github.com/ringuh/whiskerwood-catalystdefaults]GitHub[/url]

Created using the [url=https://github.com/Whiskerwood-Modding/Whiskerwood-Project]Whiskerwood modkit[/url]."
	"changenote"		"First release"
}
